G4-4 noise: exact vs epsilon vs channel capacity (depolarizing qubit, eps = 0.05)
==============================================================================
    p      exact N   eps-capacity (err<=0.05)   Holevo capacity (bits)
   0.0         2                 2               1.0000
   0.01        1                 2               0.9546
   0.05        1                 2               0.8313
   0.1         1                 2               0.7136
   0.3         1                 1               0.3902

==============================================================================
G4-5 composition
==============================================================================
  classical: N_AB = N_A N_B;  complex QM: N = d_A d_B, K+1 = (K_A+1)(K_B+1);  real QM: N = 4 for 2 rebits but
  K = 9 != (2+1)(2+1)-1 = 8 (local tomography fails) -> capacity multiplicative while state-space dimension is not.
  two gbits: local polytope 16 vertices (K=8); no-signalling polytope 24 vertices (K=8); NS check True
  min tensor (local polytope, dual effects)         : distinguishable sets of size 4: True, size 5: False
  max tensor (boxworld: NS states, NS-dual effects) : distinguishable sets of size 4: True, size 5: False
